Morning (Vim Port) — Visual Studio Code Theme

This Visual Studio Code theme is released under the Vim License.

It is a port of the Vim color scheme “morning.vim”.
Original author and maintainer: Bram Moolenaar <Bram@vim.org>
Current version of morning.vim: part of the Vim colorschemes
(https://github.com/vim/colorschemes), generated with Colortemplate,
license “Same as Vim”.

This repository is NOT the original morning.vim. It is an adaptation of its
colors to the theme format of Visual Studio Code.
Port to Visual Studio Code: Rainer Strauss (r11s), November 2026,
based on morning.vim, Last Change 2026 Oct 02.

All modifications and adaptations in this repository are provided
under the same terms as Vim itself.

